{"id":93,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"This frightful, malevolent spirit can glide through walls, appearing wherever it likes. According to rumor, victims of a Haunter's lick will wither to death day by day."},{"games":["Shield","X","FireRed"],"text":"If you get the feeling of being watched in darkness when nobody is around, Haunter is there."},{"games":["Sword","SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"Its tongue is made of gas. If licked, its victim starts shaking constantly until death eventually comes."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"By licking, it saps the victim’s life. It causes shaking that won’t stop until the victim’s demise."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"It’s dangerous to go outside alone on nights when you’re feeling sad. Haunter will catch you, and you won’t be able to go back home."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"On moonless nights, Haunter searches for someone to curse, so it’s best not to go out walking around."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"It fears the light and revels in the dark. It may be on the verge of extinction in cities that stay brightly lit at night."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"It strikes at humans from total darkness. Those licked by its cold tongue grow weaker with each passing day until they die."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Haunter is a dangerous Pokémon. If one beckons you while floating in darkness, you must never approach it. This Pokémon will try to lick you with its tongue and steal your life away."},{"games":["Y","Pearl"],"text":"It licks with its gaseous tongue to steal the victim’s life force. It lurks in darkness for prey."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"It likes to lurk in the dark and tap shoulders with a gaseous hand. Its touch causes endless shuddering."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"In total darkness, where nothing is visible, HAUNTER lurks, silently stalking its next victim."},{"games":["Diamond"],"text":"It can slip through any obstacle. It lurks inside walls to keep an eye on its foes."},{"games":["LeafGreen","Blue","Red"],"text":"Because of its ability to slip through block walls, it is said to be from another dimension."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"If a HAUNTER beckons you while it is floating in darkness, don’t approach it. This POKéMON will try to lick you with its tongue and steal your life away."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"It hides in the dark, planning to take the life of the next living thing that wanders close by."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Levitate","hidden":false,"description":"By floating in the air, the Pokémon receives full immunity to all Ground-type moves."}],"eggGroups":["Amorphous"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"cave","color":"Purple","shape":"Arms","evolution":{"id":92,"name":"Gastly","condition":null,"children":[{"id":93,"name":"Haunter","condition":"Lv. 25","children":[{"id":94,"name":"Gengar","condition":"Trade","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[0,325],[1,95],[1,109],[1,122],[1,212],[12,371],[16,180],[20,174],[24,506],[30,101],[36,389],[42,399],[48,247],[54,194],[60,138]],"machine":[491,109,174,399,605,227,203,412,263,7,374,411,492,202,441,114,506,8,196,286,118,417,101,220,566,398,809,182,244,94,240,156,184,247,421,285,806,214,188,482,180,164,241,269,851,168,87,9,85,92,390,271,433,474,261],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me3-49","name":"Haunter","set":"Perfect Order","date":"2026-03-27","rarity":"Common","number":"49","artist":null,"small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me3-49/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me3-49/large"},{"id":"me2pt5-124","name":"Haunter","set":"Ascended Heroes","date":"2026-01-30","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"124","artist":"Rianti Hidayat","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-124/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-124/large"},{"id":"me2-55","name":"Hau